WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.049
Some days are easy to read.

00:00:02.049 --> 00:00:05.259
Others, it's hard to say how you're really feeling.

00:00:05.259 --> 00:00:10.419
Easli is a mood coach that helps you notice what's going on, and make sense of it.

00:00:10.919 --> 00:00:12.689
A check-in only takes a minute.

00:00:12.689 --> 00:00:18.343
Pick your mood, name your emotions, note what you've been up to, and add a few words if you'd like.

00:00:18.843 --> 00:00:23.983
Then Easli responds with supportive coaching, based on CBT principles.

00:00:23.983 --> 00:00:28.315
On supported devices, it's written by Apple's on-device AI.

00:00:28.815 --> 00:00:32.174
Over time, Insights shows your mood trends and patterns.

00:00:32.174 --> 00:00:36.794
Connect Apple Health to see how sleep and movement line up with how you feel.

00:00:37.294 --> 00:00:42.457
Your journal keeps every entry in one place, so you can look back and see how far you've come.

00:00:42.957 --> 00:00:49.442
And when you need a moment, guided breathing, gratitude, and mindfulness exercises are just a tap away.

00:00:49.942 --> 00:00:52.170
Your entries stay on your device.

00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:52.980
No accounts.

00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:53.791
No sign-ups.

00:00:53.791 --> 00:00:56.491
Easli: a little more clarity, every day.
